Modifications
-------------
The original WHOI Cable source files in this repository are unchanged. The
modifications are:

2026-09  patches/cable-free-surface-buoy.patch modifies solver/dynamic_2d.c,
         solver/waves.c and include/model.h. In 2D dynamic runs of surface
         moorings with forcing-method = morison, the surface buoy's draft,
         buoyancy, drag area, current sampling depth and wind drag now follow
         the buoy's position relative to the local wave surface, so the buoy
         can be pulled under and resurface. Adds WaveSurfaceElevation() to
         solver/waves.c. scripts/build.sh applies the patch at build time to
         make the program cable-free; the program cable is built unmodified.
         See docs/PATCH.md.

2026-10  Added build and run scripts (scripts/), a conda environment
         (environment.yml), example input files (cases/), a plotting notebook
         (notebooks/) and documentation (README.md, docs/SETUP.md,
         docs/PATCH.md).
 